# EdgeSight — root .gitignore

# Secrets / environment — NEVER commit a real .env
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Node (extension / tooling / dashboard)
# These patterns have no leading slash, so they match at ANY depth — including
# dashboard/node_modules/ and dashboard/dist/. Dependencies are resolved from a
# lockfile and never committed; the dashboard bundle is generated by
# `cd dashboard && npm run build` and is not tracked.
# Deliberately NOT using a broad pattern such as `@*/`: scoped *source*
# directories are legitimate. Dependency folders must simply never be committed
# outside node_modules/ in the first place.
node_modules/
.npm-cache/
.browser-test/
benchmarks/output/
dist/
build/
*.log

# Python (server)
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/

# OS / editor
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/

# Session tooling — not part of EdgeSight
.remember/
